## [0.7.11a6] - 19.09.2025 PLAYTEST 
###Changed
- Heartworks(location): Buy Link option.
- Fred(core) move at the end of the turn added;
- Trace-10(core). Creates Crystals now and Upload drops Trace twice;
- Add Link location: Crystal options changed to 3 Link for 2 Crystals;
- Add Memory location: Crystal options changed to 3 Memory for 1 Crystal;
- Ransomware(aspect) chenged to "Spend X Data to Drop (X-1)";
- Evesdrop(node): Express added;
- MeercatDB(node): disabled for rework;
- chkdsk(aspect): reverted back to "3 moves in a row" (+ "this turn" removed)

###Fixed
- Fred(core) not adding Trace after a jump;
- Orwell creating Corrosion instead of Watchful Eyes; 
- Exit glitching;

This is a large patch. 
There are 3 Final bosses now and Deep Run should feel more varied overall. 
The game might be a bit harder than it was, especially at the start of the run, but there is a new location that lets you restore Hearts, so it should be manageable.

[h2][/h2] [0.7.11a5] - 18.09.2025 PLAYTEST 

[h3]Added[/h3]
- Deep starts with 1 Crystal (that means you can buy 2nd Aspect right away);
- new "Heartworks" location;
- Fred(core): Frog that jumps away from the Avatar;
- Blanche(core): Very high Firewall. Loses Strength when you drop trace, coverts Firewall into Trace at the EOT;
- Barry (100 Data Core) reworked into a final boss;
- Trace-10 Final Boss: Drop 10 Trace 10 times. 
- Fake news(node). Drops 2 Trace at EOT and loses 2 Data.;
- Lowcost plan(aspect): 75 credits upon Exit if Link = 1;
- RSS-reader(aspect): Double data gain for the first activation every turn; 
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Add Slots location is guaranteed to be present as a post-level reward at stage 4 or 5;
- Watchful Eye and Signal Jammer reworked to follow pattern "Do -1 Х. Spend 2 Data to do +3 Х";
- Reminder (node): Changed to Downtime(1), Drop 4;
- Quarantine+ (core): changed to exhaust all adjacent and gain 1 callback; 
- Paper Wall removed (tried to make another Netrunner reference, but it doesn't fit and doesn't do much); 
- Plotter cost to reboot reduced to 3;
- Greeting Card+ changed to 2x Heart + Singleton;
- Time Capsule(node) +1 Data buff; 
- Webber(core) is disabled for rework;
- Catch(node) Express added;
- Ice-9(core): Simple activation added (move again same direction);
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- frame drop during reboot should be not that bad now;
- Watchful Eyes created by Hard mode aspect didn't proc on the first turn;
- multiple Watchful eyes now proc at the same time;

[h2][0.7.11a1] - 02.09.2025 PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- Freeze(hostile node): Express, Adds 2 Firewall on Reveal, TurnStart and Activation. Moves Avatar forward when activated. 
- StableTrace core: Set Trace to 8, break 8 times to defeat. Don't reset Trace between turns;
- Deca: Set Trace and Firewall to 10, don't reset both between turns;
- LinkLossRemote(core): Remote, lose Link after move, Upload Data to restore Link. 
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- 2 aspects start in the Deep run and TestRun-3;
- Barry reworked into the Final boss;
- Nullifier removed from the 2nd stage level pool;
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Level not found fallback fixed;

[h2] [0.7.10rc1] - 30.07.2025[/h2]
These are the patch notes for the demo. They don't mention any new stuff and mostly repeat what was already mentioned in playtest patch notes for 0,7.10aX.

[h3]Added[/h3]
- new Prologue TestRun selection window;
- run Victory music;
- new animations for the level start and reboot;
- Morning Call(aspect) (Remote reach anywhere on the 1st activation);
- challenges (work in progress, available through the console only, press ` to open the console then type run.start_ch);
- new Signal Beacon interlude level on Stage 11 (refresh Beacons to gain permanent Link);
- new icons and placements for status effects;

[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Nullifier(core) rework. Exhaust only the activated node;
- Chip (core) now loses strength when Cookies node gets transformed;
- Codegate(node) rework. Protected removed, "Lose X Link" added to [Exhaust]/[Transform] triggers;
- Master Key(node). Base version Express and Limit added;
- Tapped line (aspect) reworked. "Whenever you gain Callbacks - drop that much Trace. Whenever you spend Callbacks - add that much Trace."
- Stuck Button(node) changed to "Reboot 2/3 times";
- System Update(node) Express added (+ force Complete turn on the base version).
- Stack Overflow (aspect) changed to: "[Data Overflow X]: Drop X Trace and lose X Callbacks.";
- Freemium(node) changed: (60 cred, -3 Link) to (50 cred, -2 Link);
- Network password(node) rework. (Singleton. Restore 2/3 Link. No data gain);
- Code Optimization+, Call to Action+ and Overclocking+ all changed to base + Multiuse(2);
- Flash (node) reworked. (hide adjacent, reveal up to 2/3 away);
- starting credits increased to 50;
- item shop prices lowered to 25;
- Ayrton(core) no longer restores check points upon death;

[h3]Removed[/h3]
- Voice recognition temporarily disabled;

[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Secret Dossier+(node) fix;
- Lighthouse+, Fire Extinguisher+ and Wire Burn+ bugs;
- Moving into a hidden node (with Compass) will now reveal the node for a brief moment;
- something something sound compression and stuff;

---------------------------------------------------
[h2][0.7.10a13] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- Run victory music theme;

[h3][/h3]Fixed
- several status effects visual bugs;

[h2][0.7.10a11 and 0.7.10a12] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- visual effect on reboot (+wave spawns from the activation);

[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Mnemonics fix;

[h2][0.7.10a10] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- new animations (wip) for a reboot and the level start;
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Master Key(node). Base version Express and Limit added;
- Camera flash (node) changed to: "Hide adjacent nodes, then reveal all nodes up to 2 spaces away." 
- Tapped line (aspect) reworked. "Whenever you gain Callbacks - drop that much Trace. Whenever you spend Callbacks - add that much Trace."
- Stack Overflow (aspect) changed to: "[Data Overflow X]: Drop X Trace and lose X Callbacks.";
- Stuck Button(node) changed to "Reboot 2/3 times";
- System Update(node) Express added (+ force Complete turn on the base version). 
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Dylan and Nebula nerfs;
- 2 Codegates levels in one run;

[h2][0.7.10a8] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- new "Crystals interlude" levels;
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- 2x Texture quality experiment;
- status effects visuals rework started; 
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- yesterday's bugs;

[h2][0.7.10a7] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3][/h3]Added
- new "Credits interlude" levels, new fancy segments;
- new Signal Beacon interlude level on Stage 11 (refresh Beacons to gain permanent Link);
- old Watchtower reworked into a core (Sonya, temp art, Upload, add Trace/Firewall based on distance to it);
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Level Selection mechanism reworked, something might be broken;
- shop items prices reduced to 25 (stell needs a system to inflate prices over time on some items);  
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Dylan fixed (was a copy of Thomas);

[h2][0.7.10a6] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- some sound parameters only Pavel understands what they are;
- Network password/Network Password+ changed to: "Singleton Add 2 Link"/"Singleton Add 3 Link"
###Fixed
- assorted fixes, thanks Zhibo;

[h2][0.7.10a5] - PLAYTEST[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
- new Core Tracy (Adds X Trace when data is Uploaded, double Trace damage to Link);
- sketches for Thomas, Dylan and Farid;
- initialize grid character;
- visual proc on Cokies when they get transformed;
- X Crystals and X Credits map icons;
[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Ayrton no longer restores check points upon death;
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- Moving into a hidden node (with Compass) will now reveal the node for a brief moment;[/code]

## [0.7.2p1] - 02.02.2025
###Fixed
- black screen bug is fixed for real this time;
- gallery fast scroll bug;
- temp_editor_level in deep bug;

[h2][0.7.2] - 01.02.2025[/h2]
[h3]Added
[/h3]- Signal Extender aspect (+1 to Link gain);
- "Core reference" hints for Web-Filter, Instant Message and Cookies;
- experimental DataPool shop location with flat 3-piece;
- button to open save game folder (see Options -> Misc)

[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Banhammer nerfed to Drop 5 Trace;
- first two tutorial levels are replaced by regular levels after the loss;
- Signal stabilizer: trigger moved to Start of Turn; 

[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- black screen after hitting Play bug;
- occasional random level at stage ~9;

[h2][0.7.1] - 25.01.2025[/h2]

[h3]Added[/h3]
- post run unlock windows for prologue;
- reroll price +10 with every roll;
- main menu link to blue sky account;

[h3]Removed[/h3]
- diagonal selection in Aspect Matrix (more changes in the next patch);
- extra buy for 1 Crystal in Data Pool/System Grid;
- temp: Clean Mind (node), Switch(node)
- Express from Corrosion+/Corrosion++;
- steam community link from the main menu;
- Link location character's feet and arms;

[h3]Changed[/h3]
- Link and Memory location prices +1 Crystal;
- system grid duplicator and triplet locations limited to 2 buys;  
- briefing visual changes;
- character art improved;

[h3]Fixed[/h3]
- major bug with data pool distribution after the first reboot; 
- system grid duplicator when there are no node to duplicate;

Several smaller patches with balance changes, bug fixes and some new art.

