### Added
- a couple new nodes and aspects;

### Changed 
- drop onto upgraded node will upgrade the dropped node;
- map rework (still in progress);
- two first tutorial were merged into one;
- better HUD animation (wip);

### Removed
- Heart Monitor removed (will be reworked);

### Fixed
- Codegate gets Limited keyword;

## [0.6.5] - 11-11-2024
### Added
- press ALT to toggle node description to the node's Upgraded variant;
- new core: Linda (no art);
- Flashbang node test (On reveal: Drops 3 and exhausts all adjacent);
- new art: Hyperlink, Snapshot recovery and Exception;

