- Moderator core;
- new map icons;
- end of turn button visual states;

### Changed 
- Corrosion always starts spreading with Corrosion+ plus 1 regular Corrosion per Trace;  
- new sounds for picking up data;

### Fixed
- hero panel stays on top of all locations;

### Removed
-Webber temporarily disabled;

### Added
- new music track;
- arrows between segments; 
### Changed 
- music player was rewritten to support dynamic music;
### Fixed
- Flux capacitor missing text;
- Source code+ not giving callbacks;
- texture size and video quality experiments;

### Added
- briefing window;
- tutorial runs (work in progress);
- victory sound;

### Changed 
- EMP and Code optimization buffs;
- Wall of Text +1 Data buff;
- art: aspects icons, map icons, aspect matrix window;

### Added
- Backbeat(aspect). "[Start of Turn]: If turn number is even - gain 2 Actions. Otherwise - lose 1 Action.";
- Oddball(aspect). "[When Data value becomes odd]: Drop 1 Trace.";
- graphics options(wip);
### Changed 
- Prewarm(aspect) changed to "[Start of the 1st turn]: Gain 2 Actions and add 2 Trace";
