### Added
- Unity analytics and diagnostics;
- changelog and welcome windows;
- on node drop visual effect;
- in-game menu;

### Changed 
- Chatbot(Mayson) activation changed to "Drop 5 Trace and exhaust all Instant Messages"

### Fixed 
- gallery cleanup;
- Incognito modifier clamped to 0;
- random items in the corresponding location;
